s nav label\">Disputes</span></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"nav-group\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-4\" data-name=\"Administration nav group\">\n<div class=\"nav-label\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"Administration group label\">Administration</div>\n<a class=\"nav-item\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-4-2\" data-name=\"Audit logs nav item\" href=\"#\"><i class=\"icon-history\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"history audit icon\"></i><span class=\"lbl\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"Audit logs nav label\">Audit logs</span></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"nav-priv\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-5\" data-name=\"Super administrator nav section\">\n<div class=\"nav-label\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-5-1\" data-name=\"Super administrator section label\"><i class=\"icon-shield\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-5-1-1\" data-name=\"shield security icon\"></i>Super administrator</div>\n<a class=\"nav-item\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-5-2\" data-name=\"Accounts nav item\" href=\"#\"><i class=\"icon-users\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-5-2-1\" data-name=\"users accounts icon\"></i><span class=\"lbl\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-5-2-2\" data-name=\"Accounts nav label\">Accounts</span></a>\n<a class=\"nav-item\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-5-3\" data-name=\"Administrators nav item\" href=\"#\"><i class=\"icon-lock\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-5-3-1\" data-name=\"lock administrator icon\"></i><span class=\"lbl\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-5-3-2\" data-name=\"Administrators nav label\">Administrators</span></a>\n</div>\n</nav>\n<div class=\"sidebar-foot\" data-kid=\"1-1-3\" data-name=\"sidebar footer with user profile\">\n<div class=\"me\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1\" data-name=\"signed-in user profile row\">\n<span class=\"avatar\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"user initials avatar\">TM</span>\n<div data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2\" data-name=\"user identity text container\">\n<div class=\"me-name\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"signed-in user full name\">Tarisai Mudimu</div>\n<div class=\"me-role\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2-2\" data-name=\"signed-in user role\">Super administrator</div>\n</div>\n<i class=\"