lass=\"dot\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"status dot indicator\"></span>Active</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hero-meta\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"contact details row\">\n<span data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"email contact item\"><i class=\"icon-mail\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"envelope mail icon\" data-reason=\"letter icon glyphs injected by lucide font loader script\"></i>tinashe.moyo@gmail.com</span>\n<span data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"phone contact item\"><i class=\"icon-phone\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"phone icon\" data-reason=\"letter icon glyphs injected by lucide font loader script\"></i>+263 77 214 8890</span>\n<span data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"location contact item\"><i class=\"icon-map-pin\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"map pin location icon\" data-reason=\"letter icon glyphs injected by lucide font loader script\"></i>Harare</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hero-right\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"account metadata block\">\n<div class=\"kv-inline\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"account ID key-value row\"><span class=\"k\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"account ID label\">Account ID</span><span class=\"v mono\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"account ID UUID value\">6f2a91c4-2d18-4b7e-9c31-8a5d7d3b</span></div>\n<div class=\"kv-inline\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"registration date key-value row\"><span class=\"k\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"registered label\">Registered</span><span class=\"v\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"registered date value\">14 Mar 2026</span></div>\n<div class=\"kv-inline\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-3\" data-name=\"last login key-value row\"><span class=\"k\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"last login label\">Last login</span><span class=\"v\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"last login timestamp\">22 Nov 2026, 18:04</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<div class=\"tabs\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"account tabs bar\">\n<a class=\"tab active\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"account details tab active\" href=\"#\">Account</a>\n<a class=\"tab\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"dealer profile tab\" href=\"#\">Dealer profile</a>\n<a class=\"tab\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-3\" data-name=\"marketplace activity tab\" href=\"#\">Marketplace activity</a>\n</div>\n<section class=\"panel detail\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4\" data-name=\"account detail section panel\">\n<div class=\"detail-grid\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"detail fields grid\">\n<div class=\"field-group\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"identity field group\">\n<h3 data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-1-1\" data-name=\"identity group heading\">Identity</h3>\n<div class=\"frow\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-1-2\" data-name=\"first name field row\"><span class=\"k\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"first name field label\">First name</span><span class=\"v\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"first name value\">Tinashe</span></div>\n<div class=\"frow\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-1-3\" data-name=\"last name field row\"><span class=\"k\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-1-3-1\" data-name=\"last name field label\">Last name</span><span class=\"v\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-1-3-2\" data-name=\"last name value\">Moyo</span></div>\n<div class=\"frow\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-1-4\" data-name=\"email field row\"><span class=\"k\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-1-4-1\" data-name=\"email field label\">Email</span><span class=\"v\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-1-4-2\" data-name=\"email value\">tinashe.moyo@gmail.com</span></div>\n<div class=\"frow\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-1-5\" data-name=\"phone field row\"><span class=\"k\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-1-5-1\" data-name=\"phone field label\">Phone number</span><span class=\"v\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-1-5-2\" data-name=\"phone value\">+263 77 214 8890</span></div>\n<div class=\"frow\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-1-6\" data-name=\"email verified field row\"><span class=\"k\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-1-6-1\" data-name=\"email verified label\">Email verified</span><span class=\"v\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-1-6-2\" data-name=\"email verified value\">Yes, 15 Mar 2026</span></div>\n<div class=\"frow\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-1-7\" data-name=\"account created field row\"><span class=\"k\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-1-7-1\" data-name=\"account created label\">Account created</span><span class=\"v\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-1-7-2\" data-name=\"account created timestamp value\">14 Mar 2026, 09:12</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field-group\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-2\" data-name=\"access field group\">\n<h3 data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-2-1\" data-name=\"access group heading\">Access</h3>\n<div class=\"frow\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-2-2\" data-name=\"role field row\"><span class=\"k\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"role field label\">Role</span><span class=\"v\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"role value\">user</span></div>\n<div class=\"frow\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-2-3\" data-name=\"account type field row\"><span class=\"k\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"account type label\">Account type</span><span class=\"v\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"account type value\">seller</span></div>\n<div class=\"frow\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-2-4\" data-name=\"admin level field row\"><span class=\"k\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"admin level label\">Administrator level</span><span class=\"v\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-2-4-2\" data-name=\"admin level empty value\">—</span></div>\n<div class=\"frow\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-2-5\" data-name=\"account status field row\"><span class=\"k\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-2-5-1\" data-name=\"account status label\">Account status</span><span class=\"v\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-2-5-2\" data-name=\"account status value\">active</span></div>\n<div class=\"frow\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-2-6\" data-name=\"last login field row\"><span class=\"k\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-2-6-1\" data-name=\"last login field label\">Last login</span><span class=\"v\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-2-6-2\" data-name=\"last login timestamp value\">22 Nov 2026, 18:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"frow\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-2-7\" data-name=\"deleted field row\"><span class=\"k\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-2-7-1\" data-name=\"deleted label\">Deleted</span><span class=\"v\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-2-7-2\" data-name=\"deleted empty value\">—</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"detail-foot\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2\" data-name=\"detail footer action bar\">\n<div data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"action description block\">\n<div class=\"t\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"suspend action title\">Account access</div>\n<div class=\"n\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2\" data-name=\"suspend action help text\">Suspension requires a written reason and blocks sign-in.</div>\n</div>\n<button class=\"btn btn-danger-outline\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"suspend account danger button\"><i class=\"icon-ban\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"ban prohibition icon\" data-reason=\"letter icon glyphs injected by lucide font loader script\"></i>Suspend account</button>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"scrim\" data-kid=\"1-3\" data-name=\"dialog darkening scrim overlay\"></div>\n<div aria-describedby=\"dlg-consequence\" aria-labelledby=\"dlg-title\" aria-modal=\"true\" class=\"dialog\" data-kid=\"1-4\" data-name=\"suspend account modal dialog\" role=\"dialog\">\n<div class=\"dlg-head\" data-kid=\"1-4-1\" data-name=\"dialog header\">\n<span class=\"dlg-icon\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-1\" data-name=\"warning icon container\"><i class=\"icon-shield-alert\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-1-1\" data-name=\"shield alert warning icon\" data-reason=\"letter icon glyphs injected by lucide font loader script\"></i></span>\n<div data-kid=\"1-4-1-2\" data-name=\"dialog title block\">\n<h2 data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-1\" data-name=\"dialog title\" id=\"dlg-title\">Suspend account</h2>\n<p data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2\" data-name=\"dialog description\">The change is stored on the account with your reason.</p>\n</div>\n<button aria-label=\"Close dialog\" class=\"dlg-close\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-3\" data-name=\"dialog close button\"><i class=\"icon-x\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-3-1\" data-name=\"close X icon\" data-reason=\"letter icon glyphs injected by lucide font loader script\"></i></button>\n</div>\n<div class=\"dlg-body\" data-kid=\"1-4-2\" data-name=\"dialog body\">\n<div class=\"target\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1\" data-name=\"target account summary card\">\n<span class=\"avatar\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"target account avatar\">TM</span>\n<div data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-2\" data-name=\"target account info block\">\n<div class=\"who-name\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"target account name\">Tinashe Moyo</div>\n<div class=\"who-mail\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"target account email\">tinashe.moyo@gmail.com</div>\n<div class=\"mono small\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-2-3\" data-name=\"target account ID\">6f2a91c4-2d18-4b7e-9c31-8a5d7d3b</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"transition\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2\" data-name=\"status transition row\">\n<div class=\"t-state\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"current status state\">\n<span class=\"t-label\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"current status label\">Current status</span>\n<span class=\"pill pill-active\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"current active status badge\"><span class=\"dot\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"active status dot\"></span>Active</span>\n</div>\n<i class=\"icon-arrow-right\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-2\" data-name=\"right arrow transition icon\" data-reason=\"letter icon glyphs injected by lucide font loader script\"></i>\n<div class=\"t-state\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-3\" data-name=\"after confirmation state\">\n<span class=\"t-label\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"after confirmation label\">After confirmation</span>\n<span class=\"pill pill-suspended\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"after confirmation suspended badge\"><span class=\"dot\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"suspended status dot\"></span>Suspended</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"consequence\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-3\" data-name=\"suspension consequence text\" id=\"dlg-consequence\">Suspending blocks sign-in for this account. The reason is stored on the account record.</p>\n<label class=\"r-label\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-4\" data-name=\"suspension reason label\" for=\"reason\">Reason for suspension <span class=\"req\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-4-1\" data-name=\"required field badge\">Required</span></label>\n<textarea aria-describedby=\"reason-help\" class=\"ta\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-5\" data-name=\"suspension reason textarea\" id=\"reason\">Repeated reports of odometer tampering across three listings.</textarea>\n<div class=\"r-meta\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-6\" data-name=\"character counter row\" id=\"reason-help\"><span data-kid=\"1-4-2-6-1\" data-name=\"character length constraint\">1–1000 characters</span><span class=\"tnum\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-6-2\" data-name=\"live character count\">61 / 1000</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"dlg-foot\" data-kid=\"1-4-3\" data-name=\"dialog footer action bar\">\n<button class=\"btn btn-quiet\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1\" data-name=\"dialog cancel button\">Cancel</button>\n<button class=\"btn btn-danger\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2\" data-name=\"confirm suspension danger button\">Confirm suspension</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
