sers icon\"></i><span class=\"lbl\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-5-2-2\" data-name=\"Accounts nav label\">Accounts</span></a>\n<a class=\"nav-item\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-5-3\" data-name=\"Administrators navigation link\" href=\"#\"><i class=\"icon-lock\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-5-3-1\" data-name=\"lock icon\"></i><span class=\"lbl\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-5-3-2\" data-name=\"Administrators nav label\">Administrators</span></a>\n</div>\n</nav>\n<div class=\"sidebar-foot\" data-kid=\"1-1-3\" data-name=\"signed-in user widget\">\n<div class=\"me\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1\" data-name=\"user info row\">\n<span class=\"avatar\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"user avatar initials\">TM</span>\n<div data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2\" data-name=\"user name wrapper\">\n<div class=\"me-name\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"user display name\">Tarisai Mudimu</div>\n<div class=\"me-role\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2-2\" data-name=\"user role text\">Super administrator</div>\n</div>\n<i class=\"icon-log-out logout\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-3\" data-name=\"logout icon button\"></i>\n</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n<div class=\"main\" data-kid=\"1-2\" data-name=\"main content area\">\n<header class=\"topbar\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-1\" data-name=\"top bar\" data-reason=\"content depends on current page and current user\">\n<div class=\"crumbs\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"breadcrumb trail\"><span data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"breadcrumb market segment\">Marketplace</span><span class=\"sep\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"breadcrumb separator\">/</span><strong data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-3\" data-name=\"breadcrumb current page\" data-reason=\"current page label reflects active route\">Listings</strong></div>\n<div class=\"topbar-right\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"top bar right controls\" data-reason=\"role and user reflect sign-in state\">\n<span class=\"role-chip\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"role badge\" data-reason=\"role reflects user's authorisation\"><i class=\"icon-shield-check\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"role checkmark icon\"></i>Super administrator</span>\n<button class=\"profile\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"user profile dropdown button\" data-reason=\"display name and avatar initials come from signed-in user\"><span class=\"avatar sm\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"user avatar initials\">TM</span>Tarisai Mudimu<i class=\"icon-chevron-down\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"dropdown chevron icon\"></i></button>\n</div>\n</header>\n<div class=\"page\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-2\" data-name=\"page content container\" data-reason=\"page reflects active route\">\n<div class=\"page-head\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"page heading row\">\n<h1 data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"page heading title\" data-reason=\"page title changes with active section\">Listings</h1>\n<span class=\"meta tnum\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"page summary meta\" data-reason=\"counts reflect current state\">23 pending of 816 listings</span>\n</div>\n<section aria-label=\"Filters\" class=\"panel toolbar\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"filters panel\">\n<div class=\"field grow\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"search field\">\n<label data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"search input label\" for=\"listing-search\">Search</label>\n<div class=\"input-wrap\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"search input wrapper\">\n<i class=\"icon-search\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"search magnifier icon\"></i>\n<input data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"search text input\" id=\"listing-search\" placeholder=\"Make, model, seller or listing ID\" type=\"text\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"status filter field\">\n<label data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"status label\" for=\"listing-status\">Status</label>\n<div class=\"select-wrap\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"status select wrapper\">\n<select data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"status select control\" id=\"listing-status\">\n<option data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"status option: Pending\">Pending</option>\n<option data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"status option: Active\">Active</option>\n<option data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-2-1-3\" data-name=\"status option: Suspended\">Suspended</option>\n<option data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-2-1-4\" data-name=\"status option: Rejected\">Rejected</option>\n<option data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-2-1-5\" data-name=\"status option: Sold\">Sold</option>\n<option data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-2-1-6\" data-name=\"status option: Rented\">Rented</option>\n<option data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-2-1-7\" data-name=\"status option: Draft\">Draft</option>\n</select>\n<i class=\"icon-chevron-down\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"select chevron icon\"></i>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3\" data-name=\"listing type filter field\">\n<label data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"listing type label\" for=\"listing-type\">Listing type</label>\n<div class=\"select-wrap\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"listing type select wrapper\">\n<select data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"listing type select control\" id=\"listing-type\">\n<option data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"type option: All\">All types</option>\n<option data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-2-1-2\" data-name=\"type option: For sale\">For sale</option>\n<option data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-2-1-3\" data-name=\"type option: For rent\">For rent</option>\n</select>\n<i class=\"icon-chevron-down\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"select chevron icon\"></i>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"filter-tail\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4\" data-name=\"filter result count\"><span class=\"tnum\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"results count text\" data-reason=\"text updates with current filter state\">23 results</span></div>\n</section>\n<div class=\"workspace\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"workspace grid\">\n<section aria-label=\"Pending listings queue\" class=\"panel qcol\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"pending listings queue section\" data-reason=\"row list and selection respond to filters and current page\">\n<div class=\"qhead\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"queue header\">\n<h2 data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"queue title\">Pending review</h2>\n<span class=\"cnt tnum\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1-1-2\" data-name=\"queue result count\" data-reason=\"count reflects filter state\">23 listings</span>\n</div>\n<div aria-current=\"true\" class=\"qrow selected\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"queue row: selected featured listing\" data-reason=\"selected state and contents reflect current active listing\">\n<img alt=\"White Mercedes-Benz C200 listing photo\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"listing thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/api/local/images/public/images/pexels-enesozkul-36989262.jpg\"/>\n<div class=\"qi\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1-2-2\" data-name=\"listing row info\" data-reason=\"title/location/price reflect the selected listing\">\n<div class=\"qt\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"listing title\">Mercedes-Benz C200 2015</div>\n<div class=\"qm\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"listing location\">Bulawayo</div>\n<div class=\"qp tnum\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"listing price\">$16,500</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"qmark\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1-2-3\" data-name=\"queue row selection check badge\"><i class=\"icon-check\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"checkmark icon\"></i></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qrow\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1-3\" data-name=\"queue row: second listing\" data-reason=\"row content updates with listing data\">\n<img alt=\"Orange Honda Fit listing photo\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1-3-1\" data-name=\"listing thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/api/local/images/public/images/pexels-ruvim-1807011-3541550.jpg\"/>\n<div class=\"qi\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1-3-2\" data-name=\"listing row info\">\n<div class=\"qt\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"listing title\">Honda Fit 2018</div>\n<div class=\"qm\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"listing location\">Harare</div>\n<div class=\"qp tnum\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1-3-2-3\" data-name=\"listing price\">$9,800</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qrow\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1-4\" data-name=\"queue row: third listing\" data-reason=\"row content updates with listing data\">\n<img alt=\"Blue Mazda 3 listing photo\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1-4-1\" data-name=\"listing thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/api/local/images/public/images/pexels-marino-kurunic-814205362-33567290.jpg\"/>\n<div class=\"qi\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1-4-2\" data-name=\"listing row info\">\n<div class=\"qt\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1-4-2-1\" data-name=\"listing title\">Mazda 3 2017</div>\n<div class=\"qm\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1-4-2-2\" data-name=\"listing location\">Harare</div>\n<div class=\"qp tnum\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1-4-2-3\" data-name=\"listing price\">$11,200</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qrow\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1-5\" data-name=\"queue row: fourth listing\" data-reason=\"row content updates with listing data\">\n<img alt=\"Black Honda Fit listing photo\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1-5-1\" data-name=\"listing thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/api/local/images/public/images/pexels-cripsdog-24018795.jpg\"/>\n<div class=\"qi\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1-5-2\" data-name=\"listing row info\">\n<div class=\"qt\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1-5-2-1\" data-name=\"listing title\">Honda Fit 2016</div>\n<div class=\"qm\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1-5-2-2\" data-name=\"listing location\">Mutare</div>\n<div class=\"qp tnum\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1-5-2-3\" data-name=\"listing price\">$7,400</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qrow\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1-6\" data-name=\"queue row: fifth listing\" data-reason=\"row content updates with listing data\">\n<img alt=\"White Mercedes-Benz C200 coupe listing photo\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1-6-1\" data-name=\"listing thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/api/local/images/public/images/pexels-mert-kaboglu-2148871435-30466870.jpg\"/>\n<div class=\"qi\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1-6-2\" data-name=\"listing row info\">\n<div class=\"qt\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1-6-2-1\" data-name=\"listing title\">Mercedes-Benz C200 2014</div>\n<div class=\"qm\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1-6-2-2\" data-name=\"listing location\">Gweru</div>\n<div class=\"qp tnum\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1-6-2-3\" data-name=\"listing price\">$14,900</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qnav\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1-7\" data-name=\"queue pagination row\" data-reason=\"page range text updated by scripting\">\n<span class=\"tnum\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1-7-1\" data-name=\"pagination range text\" data-reason=\"range text re-rendered by script\">1–5 of 23</span>\n<span class=\"nav-btns\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1-7-2\" data-name=\"pagination button group\" data-reason=\"buttons' enabled state reflects current page\">\n<button aria-label=\"Previous page\" class=\"iconbtn\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1-7-2-1\" data-name=\"previous page button\" disabled=\"\"><i class=\"icon-chevron-left\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1-7-2-1-1\" data-name=\"left chevron icon\"></i></button>\n<button aria-label=\"Next page\" class=\"iconbtn\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1-7-2-2\"><i class=\"icon-chevron-right\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1-7-2-2-1\"></i></button>\n</span>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section aria-label=\"Selected listing\" class=\"panel evidence\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2\">\n<div class=\"ev-head\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-1\">\n<div data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-1-1\">\n<h2 data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-1-1-1\">Mercedes-Benz C200 2015</h2>\n<div class=\"ev-sub\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-1-1-2\">\n<span class=\"mono\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-1-1-2-1\">Listing 2b7e40d1</span>\n<span data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-1-1-2-2\">Submitted 23 Nov 2026, 05:48</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"pill pill-pending\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-1-2\"><span class=\"dot\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-1-2-1\"></span>Pending review</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ev-body\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2\">\n<img alt=\"White Mercedes-Benz C200 photographed for the listing\" class=\"ev-img\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-1\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/api/local/images/public/images/pexels-enesozkul-36989262.jpg\"/>\n<div class=\"specs\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-2\">\n<span class=\"spec\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-2-1\">2015</span>\n<span class=\"spec\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-2-2\">96,300 km</span>\n<span class=\"spec\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-2-3\">Automatic</span>\n<span class=\"spec\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-2-4\">Petrol</span>\n<span class=\"spec\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-2-5\">Good condition</span>\n<span class=\"spec\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-2-6\">Sedan</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"evgrid\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-3\">\n<div class=\"eg\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-3-1\"><div class=\"k\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-3-1-1\">Price</div><div class=\"v tnum\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-3-1-2\">$16,500 USD</div></div>\n<div class=\"eg\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-3-2\"><div class=\"k\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-3-2-1\">Listing type</div><div class=\"v\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-3-2-2\">For sale</div></div>\n<div class=\"eg\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-3-3\"><div class=\"k\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-3-3-1\">Seller</div><div class=\"v\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-3-3-2\">Farai Mutasa, private seller</div></div>\n<div class=\"eg\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-3-4\"><div class=\"k\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-3-4-1\">Seller phone</div><div class=\"v\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-3-4-2\">+263 77 512 6640</div></div>\n<div class=\"eg\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-3-5\"><div class=\"k\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-3-5-1\">Location</div><div class=\"v\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-3-5-2\">42 Fife Street, Bulawayo</div></div>\n<div class=\"eg\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-3-6\"><div class=\"k\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-3-6-1\">Listing ID</div><div class=\"v mono\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-3-6-2\">2b7e40d1-9c44-4a18-8f02-6d51c9b34e88</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-4\">\n<span class=\"k\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-4-1\">Seller description</span>\n              Full service history with the book. New tyres fitted in September, air conditioning serviced.\n            </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ev-foot\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-3\">\n<button class=\"btn btn-quiet danger-text\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-3-1\"><i class=\"icon-ban\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-3-1-1\"></i>Suspend listing</button>\n<div class=\"ev-actions\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-3-2\">\n<button class=\"btn btn-outline\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-3-2-1\">Reject</button>\n<button class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-3-2-2\"><i class=\"icon-check\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-3-2-2-1\"></i>Approve listing</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
